  "stageId": "a001_04",
  "title": "污点证人",
  "storyCode": "GT-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fdd750dc50f81f01ae504684ea219c89b446d3d5f56098a2d2fa23d142eea9ef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "text": "这家伙是个瘸的！先解决掉他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "格拉尼！继续耗下去，我们全得交代在这儿了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "就算你这么说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "快！带着可萝尔走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "我受了伤，会拖慢你们的速度！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "之后我会找办法和你们会合的！走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "说好了，记得要来拿你的那份！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "text": "她们跑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "text": "你们的敌人是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "......交战的声音似乎平息下来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "但是抱歉，可萝尔，现在我们没有休息的时间，还得快走才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "没事......那个，鲍勃先生他，不知道怎么样了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可能，要给他一些时间吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "给他些时间......？你是说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可萝尔！你没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "抱歉，被这个树根绊了一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "来，拉住我的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......谢谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "能走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......没事的，只是擦伤。就像你说的，我们还是别停下脚步比较好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "只要穿过森林就是莫拉蒂山的山脚下了，我们得进入半山腰第二个洞窟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "只能从洞口进去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "是的，里面还有很多岔路和暗道，不过我知道该怎么走。宝藏就在洞窟的最深处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "嗯。这样的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "咦？好、好可怕的声音......远处有什么爆炸了吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "仔细听，还有呐喊和惨叫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "是战斗的声音。还没结束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "......可萝尔，你害怕吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......我很害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "但是，为了让我的村子平静下来，让我们的土地重归安宁......我也有一定要去做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "是吗……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你真坚强啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "没事。事不宜迟，我们继续前进吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
